  "rules": [
    "Headlines are sentence case and end with a full stop.",
    "The last word of a headline may be set in Lamp Gold (.lit) or Mist (.dim) \u2014 never both in one composition.",
    "Fraunces is always weight 300 (Light); use opsz 144 above 48 px, 72 for 24\u201348 px, 36 below.",
    "Inter Tight is for headings/labels (600) and data (500); Inter for everything read.",
    "Never use Inter Tight below 11 px or Fraunces below 16 px.",
    "Tabular numerals (tnum) in every table, invoice, quotation and stat.",
    "Letter-spaced caps only for eyebrows and counters; never letter-space Fraunces.",
    "Paragraph spacing = 1 line; no indents. Measure 60\u201372 characters."
  ]
